{"speciesId":777,"names":{"fr":"Togedemaru","es":"Togedemaru","en":"Togedemaru","ja":"トゲデマル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Les épines de ce Pokémon sont normalement baissées, mais quand il s’énerve, elles se dressent afin de pourfendre ses agresseurs."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando se siente amenazado, eriza las púas de su lomo para pinchar a quien ose atacarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The spiny fur on its back is normally at rest. When this Pokémon becomes agitated, its fur stands on end and stabs into its attackers."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"背中の ハリの 毛は 普段は 寝ている。 興奮すると 逆立ち 襲ってくる 敵を 突き刺すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Sa longue épine dorsale lui sert de paratonnerre. Il attire les éclairs et emmagasine la foudre dans sa poche électrique."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"El apéndice de su cabeza actúa a modo de pararrayos. Aprovecha la energía de los rayos que atrae para llenar su bolsa eléctrica."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The long hairs on its back act as lightning rods. The bolts of lightning it attracts are stored as energy in its electric sac."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"背中の 長い 毛は 導雷針。 落雷を 引き寄せ 雷を 浴びると 電気袋に 溜め込む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les quatorze épines de son dos se hérissent de leur propre chef quand il est surpris ou excité."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Eriza inconscientemente las 14 púas de su lomo cuando se asusta o se pone nervioso."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When it’s surprised or agitated, the 14 fur spikes on its back will stand up involuntarily."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"１４本の 背中の ハリの 毛は びっくりしたり 興奮することが あると 勝手に 逆立ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il ne produit pas beaucoup d’électricité par lui-même, aussi se recharge-t-il quand il y a de l’orage."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Como no se le da bien generar electricidad por sí mismo, se abastece con la de los rayos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its capacity to produce electricity is somewhat limited, so it gets charged up by letting lightning strike it!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"電気を 作る 力は あまり 強くないので かみなりを 浴びて 充電 するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Grâce à sa longue épine dorsale, il capte le tonnerre et les attaques des Pokémon Électrik, puis stocke leur courant dans sa poche électrique."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Utiliza el apéndice de la cabeza para absorber los rayos o los ataques de los Pokémon de tipo Eléctrico para recargar su bolsa."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"With the long hairs on its back, this Pokémon takes in electricity from other electric Pokémon. It stores what it absorbs in an electric sac."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"背中の 長い 毛で 雷や でんきポケモンの 電撃を 受けて 電気袋に 充電する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"En cas de danger, il se roule en boule, dresse ses épines dorsales et lance des décharges électriques au hasard."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando se encuentra en peligro, se hace una bola, eriza las púas del lomo y propina descargas eléctricas a diestro y siniestro."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"When it’s in trouble, it curls up into a ball, makes its fur spikes stand on end, and then discharges electricity indiscriminately."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ピンチになると 体を 丸めて 背中の とげとげを 逆立てると でたらめに 電撃を 撃ちまくる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":777,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"twineedle","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"pin-missile","learns":[[17,"level-up",45],[18,"level-up",45],[20,"level-up",30],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-shock","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",15]]